(5. Sick Leave, Physician Certificates, and Probation Limits) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Confirmed shore staff receive 12 paid sick days per calendar year, credited in) Tj
0 -15 Td
(full on January 1 and non-cumulative across years.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Single-day or two-day sick absences require notification to the line manager) Tj
0 -15 Td
(before 09:30 local time. Consecutive sick absences of 3 or more working days) Tj
0 -15 Td
(require a licensed physician fitness-to-work certificate uploaded to the HR portal) Tj
0 -15 Td
(within 48 hours of returning.) Tj
0 -15 Td
