0 -15 Td
(maximum of 2 paid emergency sick days; any sick days taken from the 3rd day onward) Tj
0 -15 Td
(during probation are unpaid.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(More than 6 separate uncertified sick episodes in any rolling 12-month period) Tj
0 -15 Td
(triggers a formal occupational attendance review with HR.) Tj
0 -15 Td
() Tj
0 -15 Td
