0 -15 Td
(Primary caregivers with at least 6 months of continuous shore tenure receive 16) Tj
0 -15 Td
(weeks of 100 percent paid parental leave upon birth or legal adoption placement.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Employees with 3 to 6 months tenure receive 8 weeks paid plus up to 8 weeks unpaid) Tj
0 -15 Td
(job-protected leave.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Secondary caregivers receive 4 weeks of 100 percent paid parental leave regardless) Tj
0 -15 Td
(of gender, split into at most 2 blocks taken within 12 months.) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Parental leave requests must be submitted in writing at least 30 calendar days) Tj
0 -15 Td
(before the expected start date, except in premature birth emergencies.) Tj
0 -15 Td
